# Machine-readable citation metadata. GitHub renders a "Cite this repository" button from this file.
# After enabling the Zenodo GitHub integration and cutting a release, add the minted DOI below
# (uncomment `doi:` and the `identifiers:` block) so every versioned snapshot is citeable.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI Price Index"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "RoninForge"
    website: "https://roninforge.org"
abstract: >-
  An open, dated, first-party-sourced record of AI model API prices over time.
  Every price carries a verifiable first-party source and the date it was last
  validated, including historical prices, so past token costs can be valued
  point-in-time. Maintained with automated daily checks and human review of
  every price change.
url: "https://roninforge.org/data/ai-price-index/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RoninForge/ai-price-index"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - AI model pricing
  - LLM API prices
  - token pricing
  - price history
  - point-in-time pricing
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20730241
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20730241
    description: The concept DOI for all versions of the AI Price Index dataset.
